---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const updatedAt = new Date("2026-08-25T00:00:00Z");
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Read how Kreativ Auto handles analytics, advertising cookies, affiliate links, and visitor privacy."
  modifiedTime={updatedAt}
  enableAds={false}
>
  <div class="container-shell py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="surface hero-frame p-8 sm:p-10">
      <div class="grid gap-8 xl:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr]">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Privacy Policy</p>
          <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl">How privacy works on Kreativ Auto</h1>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-steel">
            Kreativ Auto publishes automotive guides and uses standard website tools to understand traffic, maintain the service, and support advertising or affiliate revenue.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-steel">
            Last updated August 25, 2026.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="accent-panel p-6">
          <p class="eyebrow">Short version</p>
          <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4">
            <div class="soft-panel p-4">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-steel">No account system</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-steel">Kreativ Auto does not ask readers to create an account or submit payment details.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="soft-panel p-4">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-steel">Cookies and ads</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-steel">Optional analytics loads only after a visitor chooses to accept it. Advertising is disabled.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="mt-10 surface p-6 sm:p-8">
      <p class="eyebrow">Information collected</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-ink">What may be processed</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4">
        <div class="editorial-card">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Basic usage data</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-steel">
            After a visitor accepts optional analytics, Google Analytics and Cloudflare Web Analytics may process page views, referring pages, approximate location, browser type, device type, and aggregate interaction events such as navigation, search-result, and guide clicks.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="editorial-card">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Email you send voluntarily</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-steel">
            If you email Kreativ Auto, the message, email address, and any details you include are used to read and respond to that message.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="editorial-card">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Affiliate link activity</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-steel">
            Affiliate partners may receive information when you click an outbound retailer or product link, including information needed to attribute a qualifying purchase.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10 surface p-6 sm:p-8">
      <p class="eyebrow">Advertising</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-ink">Google AdSense is disabled</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm leading-6 text-steel">
        <p>
          Kreativ Auto does not currently load Google AdSense or another advertising script on the public site.
        </p>
        <p>
          The analytics choice on this site is not an advertising consent management platform. Before AdSense is enabled, Kreativ Auto will configure a Google-certified consent management platform wherever Google's consent requirements apply, including the EEA, United Kingdom, and Switzerland.
        </p>
        <p>
          Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a class="font-semibold text-accent hover:text-ink" href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="nofollow noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>.
          Users can also learn about broader advertising opt-out options at <a class="font-semibold text-accent hover:text-ink" href="https://www.aboutads.info/" rel="nofollow noopener">aboutads.info</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Google explains how it uses information from sites and apps that use its services at <a class="font-semibold text-accent hover:text-ink" href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="nofollow noopener">Google's partner sites policy page</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          If another advertising provider is enabled later, this policy will be updated before its script is loaded.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10 surface p-6 sm:p-8">
      <p class="eyebrow">Analytics</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-ink">Google Analytics and Cloudflare Web Analytics</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm leading-6 text-steel">
        <p>Google Analytics and Cloudflare Web Analytics load only after a visitor selects Accept analytics in the Privacy choices panel. Rejecting optional analytics prevents those analytics scripts from loading. Analytics data is reviewed in aggregate and is not used to provide one-to-one repair advice.</p>
        <p>Search measurement records search starts, result-list views, result selections, and no-result events without sending the search phrase as an analytics event parameter.</p>
        <p>Email-link clicks are counted as a contact interaction without sending the email address as an analytics event parameter.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10 surface p-6 sm:p-8">
      <p class="eyebrow">Choices</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-ink">How readers can manage privacy choices</h2>
      <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-steel">
        <li class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3">Use Privacy choices in the footer to accept or reject optional analytics, or to change an earlier selection.</li>
        <li class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3">Browser settings can block, delete, or limit cookies.</li>
        <li class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3">Google Ads Settings can be used to manage personalized advertising preferences.</li>
        <li class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3">AdSense remains disabled until a Google-certified consent management platform is configured for applicable regions.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10 surface p-6 sm:p-8">
      <p class="eyebrow">Third parties</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-ink">Outbound links and external services</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm leading-6 text-steel">
        <p>
          Kreativ Auto links to retailer pages, manufacturer pages, image-source pages, and other external websites. Those sites have their own privacy practices, cookie settings, and terms.
        </p>
        <p>
          Product links may use affiliate tracking parameters. Google Analytics and Cloudflare Web Analytics may process browser and device information only after optional analytics has been accepted. Any future advertising service will be added only with the required consent handling.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10 surface p-6 sm:p-8">
      <p class="eyebrow">Retention and security</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-ink">How long information is kept</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm leading-6 text-steel">
        <p>
          Analytics and advertising data are retained according to the settings and policies of the service providers used. Email messages are kept only as long as needed to respond, track a correction, or maintain a reasonable record of the request.
        </p>
        <p>
          No website can guarantee perfect security, but Kreativ Auto does not ask readers to create accounts, enter payment information, or submit sensitive repair records through the site.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10 surface p-6 sm:p-8">
      <p class="eyebrow">Children</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-ink">Children's privacy</h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-6 text-steel">
        Kreativ Auto is written for drivers, car owners, and used-car shoppers. It is not directed at children and does not knowingly collect personal information from children.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10 surface p-6 sm:p-8">
      <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-ink">Privacy questions</h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-6 text-steel">
        For privacy questions or correction requests, contact <a class="font-semibold text-accent hover:text-ink" href="mailto:info@kreativauto.com">info@kreativauto.com</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
